<title>UK: London gold fixes lower, palladium tightens.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes lower, palladium tightens.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $339.55 vs $340.20. Quiet after some selling under $340.00 found support. May test $338.00 but wide moves unlikely ahead of option expiry next week.</p>
<p>SILVER - Steady, barely changed at $4.75/$4.77.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Just firmer at $414.00/$418.00. Barely moved on non-show of Russian exports. PALLADIUM - Up $6.50 at $198.00/$200.00 Supply tight, market nervous.</p>
</text>
